WEBVTT

00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:05.500
Everyone, when you're watching Deltora Quest,

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:09.400
make sure you're in a well-lit
room and sit far away from the TV!

00:00:17.830 --> 00:00:24.040
You are my sun now

00:00:25.120 --> 00:00:28.460
We all go through bad times

00:00:28.460 --> 00:00:31.460
no matter who you are

00:00:31.920 --> 00:00:36.890
So don't go hanging your head and feeling down

00:00:38.930 --> 00:00:45.600
Keep your head up until your heart's sky

00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:50.980
is clear again

00:00:51.860 --> 00:00:56.360
No matter where you are in this world

00:00:56.360 --> 00:00:59.870
if you're crying and trembling all alone

00:00:59.870 --> 00:01:05.210
I'll search for you, I promise

00:01:05.410 --> 00:01:08.880
Love will show me the way

00:01:10.250 --> 00:01:16.720
The sun dreams countless times

00:01:17.340 --> 00:01:23.520
Forever and always from the horizon

00:01:24.140 --> 00:01:30.900
Its shining light gives energy

00:01:31.940 --> 00:01:38.240
After all, you are my sun now

00:01:56.660 --> 00:02:01.870
<i>A revived Fallow and the seven
Ak-Baba attack Lief and his friends.</i>

00:02:01.870 --> 00:02:08.130
<i>Lief managed to slay Fallow, but the
Belt's gems were scattered through the air.</i>

00:02:08.450 --> 00:02:12.700
<i>The people of the seven tribes moved to
protect the falling gems with their lives.</i>

00:02:12.700 --> 00:02:16.890
<i>And in the midst of all this, Endon
realised the secret of the Belt.</i>

00:02:24.600 --> 00:02:26.000
Curse you!

00:02:26.600 --> 00:02:28.100
Curse you!

00:02:28.100 --> 00:02:30.600
You shall not be forgiven!

00:02:30.600 --> 00:02:31.820
It's him...!

00:02:31.820 --> 00:02:34.200
So he has finally shown himself...

00:02:35.000 --> 00:02:36.900
This is the Shadow Lord?

00:02:41.800 --> 00:02:45.900
I will put an end to all of this!

00:02:52.700 --> 00:02:53.700
Father!

00:03:03.800 --> 00:03:04.360
Lief!

00:03:13.800 --> 00:03:15.000
Darling!

00:03:15.900 --> 00:03:16.830
Lief...

00:03:16.860 --> 00:03:18.240
Lief...!

00:03:18.280 --> 00:03:20.800
The right order...

00:03:20.800 --> 00:03:23.600
Put the gems back into the Belt...

00:03:25.100 --> 00:03:28.250
The gems must be in the right order...!

00:03:29.200 --> 00:03:30.020
Father!

00:03:30.500 --> 00:03:31.700
Father!

00:03:32.100 --> 00:03:33.550
Lief, don't!

00:03:33.900 --> 00:03:36.400
Obey Endon's words!

00:03:36.400 --> 00:03:38.800
That is his wish!

00:03:38.800 --> 00:03:43.400
And it's also the wish of
everyone who relies upon you!

00:03:43.400 --> 00:03:45.700
Set the gems into the Belt!

00:03:47.100 --> 00:03:48.570
Doom...

00:04:13.000 --> 00:04:14.300
Lief!

00:04:17.000 --> 00:04:17.680
Lief!!

00:04:26.100 --> 00:04:28.900
<i>The right order, Lief...</i>

00:04:29.300 --> 00:04:31.100
<i>The right order...</i>

00:04:31.600 --> 00:04:34.000
<i>What do you mean, Father?</i>

00:04:35.350 --> 00:04:37.800
Now, listen. I will read it once more.

00:04:37.800 --> 00:04:39.200
Okay, Father!

00:04:39.900 --> 00:04:44.300
"The seven gems, each with their own power.

00:04:44.300 --> 00:04:50.720
When they truly come together as one,
they will unleash an even greater power."

00:04:52.500 --> 00:04:54.600
<i>Truly become one...</i>

00:04:55.100 --> 00:04:56.400
<i>Truly...</i>

00:04:57.700 --> 00:04:58.680
<i>That's it!</i>

00:05:02.800 --> 00:05:04.310
Shadow Lord!

00:05:07.000 --> 00:05:12.200
Adin the blacksmith received a
gem from each of the seven tribes,

00:05:12.600 --> 00:05:14.740
and founded this kingdom!

00:05:17.200 --> 00:05:23.400
That's why he took the first letter of each gem and named it 'Deltora'!

00:05:24.600 --> 00:05:28.300
Therefore, the correct order of the gems is:

00:05:28.500 --> 00:05:30.600
<i>D for Diamond.</i>

00:05:30.600 --> 00:05:32.600
<i>E for Emerald.</i>

00:05:32.600 --> 00:05:34.800
<i>L for Lapis lazuli.</i>

00:05:34.800 --> 00:05:36.500
<i>T for Topaz.</i>

00:05:36.500 --> 00:05:38.200
<i>O for Opal.</i>

00:05:38.200 --> 00:05:39.700
<i>R for Ruby.</i>

00:05:39.700 --> 00:05:42.400
<i>And lastly, A for Amethyst.</i>

00:05:42.400 --> 00:05:46.700
<i>When they all come together,
it becomes 'Deltora'!</i>

00:05:50.100 --> 00:05:52.200
My friends from the seven tribes!

00:05:53.300 --> 00:05:58.500
Once again, we must place
each of your gems into this belt!

00:05:58.500 --> 00:05:59.820
Lief...!

00:06:03.800 --> 00:06:04.830
Manus!

00:06:05.100 --> 00:06:06.100
Lief!

00:06:13.000 --> 00:06:14.200
<i>The ruby.</i>

00:06:14.200 --> 00:06:18.340
<i>When it senses evil intent, or the
presence of monsters, its colour will fade.</i>

00:06:18.700 --> 00:06:22.700
<i>This gem is from the Lake of Tears.</i>

00:06:31.100 --> 00:06:32.000
Manus!

00:06:32.000 --> 00:06:33.190
Lief!

00:06:34.700 --> 00:06:36.800
Here, the ruby!

00:06:37.400 --> 00:06:39.400
Thank you, Manus.

00:06:48.400 --> 00:06:52.500
<i>The emerald. When it detects the
presence of evil, its colour will fade.</i>

00:06:52.500 --> 00:06:56.600
<i>It possesses the power to ease pain,
heal wounds and neutralise poison.</i>

00:06:57.200 --> 00:06:57.710
Gla-Thon!

00:06:59.700 --> 00:07:02.840
<i>This gem is from Dread Mountain.</i>

00:07:09.600 --> 00:07:11.140
Here it comes, Lief!

00:07:17.300 --> 00:07:18.280
Lief!

00:07:18.700 --> 00:07:20.300
Glock!

00:07:22.800 --> 00:07:25.000
Catch it, Lief!

00:07:25.000 --> 00:07:26.400
<i>The diamond.</i>

00:07:26.400 --> 00:07:30.000
<i>It grants strength and courage
to those with righteous hearts,</i>

00:07:30.000 --> 00:07:33.300
<i>shielding them from misfortune
and leading them to true love.</i>

00:07:46.600 --> 00:07:50.200
<i>This gem is from the Valley of the Lost.</i>

00:07:55.800 --> 00:08:00.320
<i>The lapis lazuli. Its divine power makes
it a strong talisman against evil.</i>

00:08:04.300 --> 00:08:08.400
<i>This gem is from the Shifting Sands.</i>

00:08:12.800 --> 00:08:14.200
<i>The amethyst.</i>

00:08:14.200 --> 00:08:20.500
<i>It calms the heart, cures diseases
and fades in the presence of poisons.</i>

00:08:22.800 --> 00:08:26.510
<i>We found this gem in the Maze of the Beast.</i>

00:08:30.900 --> 00:08:31.800
Steven!

00:08:31.800 --> 00:08:32.600
Nevets!

00:08:36.400 --> 00:08:40.070
<i>The opal. It can show glimpses of the future.</i>

00:08:40.500 --> 00:08:41.500
Prin!

00:08:41.500 --> 00:08:42.320
Lief!

00:08:43.800 --> 00:08:47.500
<i>We found this gem in the City of the Rats.</i>

00:08:58.900 --> 00:09:02.420
<i>It's thanks to everyone's
strength that I've come this far!</i>

00:09:03.510 --> 00:09:06.200
The last one left is the topaz!

00:09:12.000 --> 00:09:12.900
Lief!

00:09:17.100 --> 00:09:17.980
Shit...!

00:09:18.500 --> 00:09:19.500
Barda!

00:09:25.900 --> 00:09:27.100
Lief...!

00:09:28.600 --> 00:09:29.700
Shit!

00:09:29.700 --> 00:09:30.800
Lief!

00:09:32.000 --> 00:09:33.000
Barda!

00:09:33.700 --> 00:09:35.950
Barda, give the gem to me!

00:09:36.300 --> 00:09:38.210
I will take it to Lief!

00:09:39.200 --> 00:09:40.210
Hurry!

00:09:40.900 --> 00:09:42.210
I'll leave it to you!

00:09:54.500 --> 00:09:56.400
Thank you, Filli, Kree!

00:09:57.700 --> 00:09:58.900
Lief!

00:09:59.700 --> 00:10:00.480
Jasmine!

00:10:05.300 --> 00:10:08.100
Lief, it's the last one, the topaz!

00:10:17.800 --> 00:10:20.000
Jasmine!!

00:10:27.800 --> 00:10:29.300
Lief! Jasmine!

00:10:29.800 --> 00:10:30.800
Lief!!

00:11:10.800 --> 00:11:12.700
This light...

00:11:12.700 --> 00:11:14.400
I see, it's from the Belt...

00:11:23.600 --> 00:11:24.700
Jasmine!

00:11:28.000 --> 00:11:29.400
God damn it...!

00:11:35.500 --> 00:11:36.600
Jasmine!

00:11:38.700 --> 00:11:40.000
Jasmine...!

00:11:42.200 --> 00:11:43.400
Jasmine!

00:11:48.500 --> 00:11:49.460
Lief...

00:11:50.600 --> 00:11:51.630
Jasmine...

00:11:55.500 --> 00:11:57.140
It's so bright...

00:11:57.500 --> 00:11:59.700
It's the light of the Belt.

00:11:59.700 --> 00:12:01.640
I can see you thanks to this.

00:12:05.100 --> 00:12:06.900
That's right, the topaz!

00:12:18.400 --> 00:12:20.990
The last one... the topaz...

00:12:59.100 --> 00:13:01.450
Th-This is...!

00:13:02.100 --> 00:13:03.800
Wh-What is that?!

00:13:22.300 --> 00:13:23.900
Th-That is...

00:14:08.400 --> 00:14:10.000
That is...

00:14:10.000 --> 00:14:13.400
Adin, as depicted in 'The Belt of Deltora'.

00:14:19.610 --> 00:14:21.360
Begone!

00:14:43.000 --> 00:14:46.010
This light...

00:15:17.300 --> 00:15:19.590
So this is the power of the Belt?

00:15:33.200 --> 00:15:34.600
Curse you...!

00:15:34.600 --> 00:15:36.400
You foolish...!

00:16:21.200 --> 00:16:24.360
This is the true power of the Belt of Deltora?

00:16:26.600 --> 00:16:29.400
It's probably not just the Belt's power.

00:16:29.800 --> 00:16:33.900
With all of us working together as one,
it must have brought about a miracle.

00:16:35.500 --> 00:16:36.620
Lief!

00:16:37.000 --> 00:16:38.500
Hey!

00:16:38.500 --> 00:16:41.000
Lief!

00:16:43.100 --> 00:16:44.200
Everyone...!

00:16:45.300 --> 00:16:46.900
Kree! Filli!

00:17:06.000 --> 00:17:09.600
With this, Deltora has been saved.

00:17:11.200 --> 00:17:12.370
Father...

00:17:12.700 --> 00:17:15.300
My wish has finally come true...

00:17:15.300 --> 00:17:19.000
My remarkable son has made it so.

00:17:20.600 --> 00:17:25.000
The reason I raised you as a blacksmith's son, Lief...

00:17:25.400 --> 00:17:28.890
is because I wanted you to learn.

00:17:29.600 --> 00:17:32.900
To learn that a king must
understand his people, love them,

00:17:32.900 --> 00:17:35.600
and become their greatest ally.

00:17:35.600 --> 00:17:38.000
You have my apologies, Barda.

00:17:38.600 --> 00:17:39.800
Not at all.

00:17:39.800 --> 00:17:40.910
It was for the best.

00:17:42.600 --> 00:17:47.500
All of you have achieved
everything that I could not.

00:17:49.300 --> 00:17:51.900
You went on a journey with your friends,

00:17:51.900 --> 00:17:55.100
and restored the bond between the seven tribes.

00:17:59.500 --> 00:18:01.700
Thank you so much.

00:18:02.700 --> 00:18:04.000
Darling!

00:18:10.700 --> 00:18:14.900
This battle to restore Deltora...

00:18:14.900 --> 00:18:19.390
was full of nothing but
obstacles right to the very end.

00:18:19.900 --> 00:18:24.900
But, I've always loved those kinds of stories.

00:18:26.600 --> 00:18:33.200
Because those stories seem to
always have happy endings.

00:18:34.100 --> 00:18:40.960
Just like... our... story...

00:19:16.800 --> 00:19:18.080
Father...

00:19:19.800 --> 00:19:23.600
I will take on the responsibility
of the Kingdom of Deltora.

00:19:46.000 --> 00:19:48.200
Let us meet again!

00:19:48.200 --> 00:19:50.000
I wish you well!

00:19:50.000 --> 00:19:53.000
The next time we come here,
it will be a proper palace again.

00:19:53.000 --> 00:19:54.600
I'm looking forward to it!

00:20:01.500 --> 00:20:04.400
Therefore, this pillar isn't necessary.

00:20:04.400 --> 00:20:05.800
I see...

00:20:37.100 --> 00:20:39.200
Jasmine!

00:20:41.000 --> 00:20:42.200
Lief...

00:20:43.900 --> 00:20:46.800
Are you leaving, Jasmine?

00:20:47.700 --> 00:20:51.100
Palaces are like prisons to me.

00:20:51.100 --> 00:20:55.400
Rather than tidy gardens, living in
the forest would suit me better-

00:20:55.400 --> 00:20:59.000
We can break the prison walls!

00:20:59.000 --> 00:21:04.200
And we can turn those tidy
gardens into lush, green forests!

00:21:04.200 --> 00:21:07.200
The city of Del will be reborn!

00:21:07.200 --> 00:21:10.100
To make that a reality,
we have a lot of work to do.

00:21:10.100 --> 00:21:14.200
I need your strength and courage!

00:21:14.200 --> 00:21:17.100
There is nothing I can do.

00:21:17.100 --> 00:21:20.900
I'm a wild girl; short tempered, selfish...

00:21:20.900 --> 00:21:22.830
That's exactly the Jasmine that I need!

00:21:23.300 --> 00:21:25.000
The current you.

00:21:25.800 --> 00:21:27.800
The real you.

00:21:28.200 --> 00:21:29.830
That kind of Jasmine.

00:21:35.200 --> 00:21:36.700
I think so too.

00:21:38.000 --> 00:21:39.840
Kree... Barda...

00:21:40.600 --> 00:21:41.800
Jasmine.

00:21:44.700 --> 00:21:46.000
Alright then.

00:21:46.000 --> 00:21:48.800
I'll stay here for a bit longer.

00:21:48.800 --> 00:21:51.900
You need me after all, Lief.

00:21:51.900 --> 00:21:55.370
Just like how your father needed Doom.

00:21:58.500 --> 00:22:00.380
Thank you, Jasmine.

00:22:01.000 --> 00:22:02.600
Lief!

00:22:02.600 --> 00:22:04.600
Jasmine!

00:22:04.600 --> 00:22:05.660
Manus!

00:22:06.200 --> 00:22:07.500
Lief.

00:22:07.500 --> 00:22:10.300
Manus needs you for a bit.

00:22:10.300 --> 00:22:12.000
You three!

00:22:12.000 --> 00:22:14.680
What are you chatting about over there?

00:22:15.440 --> 00:22:17.300
It's nothing!

00:22:17.300 --> 00:22:18.900
I'll be right over!

00:22:18.900 --> 00:22:21.900
Let's go back! Everyone is waiting!

00:22:21.900 --> 00:22:23.600
Yeah.

00:22:22.350 --> 00:22:23.600
Right.

00:22:47.550 --> 00:22:53.300
I would be lying to you

00:22:53.470 --> 00:22:59.100
if I said I wasn't lonely

00:22:59.850 --> 00:23:05.650
I know I'm not being honest

00:23:06.190 --> 00:23:11.450
but I just can't put it into words

00:23:12.320 --> 00:23:18.410
It's for the sake of our dreams

00:23:20.080 --> 00:23:22.000
At this point

00:23:22.080 --> 00:23:27.630
to sing "I love you" to a faraway you

00:23:28.000 --> 00:23:33.970
my voice would simply fade into the wind

00:23:34.180 --> 00:23:40.270
In a way, that's worse than saying "goodbye"

00:23:40.390 --> 00:23:47.360
But someday our dreams will bloom

00:23:47.730 --> 00:23:55.740
Dreams X Dreams

00:24:06.400 --> 00:24:09.400
Barda, Jasmine, Doom.

00:24:09.400 --> 00:24:11.360
The warriors of the seven tribes.

00:24:11.360 --> 00:24:14.300
Along with the friends we met on our journey.

00:24:14.300 --> 00:24:17.500
Thanks to them, peace has returned to Deltora.

00:24:18.100 --> 00:24:20.120
But, we can't let down our guard.

00:24:20.120 --> 00:24:23.500
The Shadow Lord is looking
for his chance to return.

00:24:24.300 --> 00:24:27.020
The city of Del is under
attack from Ols once again.

00:24:28.300 --> 00:24:31.200
Next time, 'Our Second Adventurous Journey'.

00:24:28.770 --> 00:24:34.740
Our Second Adventurous Journey

00:24:31.770 --> 00:24:34.730
Our adventure isn't over yet!

00:24:49.750 --> 00:24:54.800
See you next time
